    {
      "id": 992000100010, "plugin": "Cardinal", "model": "TextEditor", "pos": [170, 0],
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "", "lang": "None", "width": 35,
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / LUMINOUS PORTAMENTO DUETS\n\nTwo eight-voice gliding oscillator manuals\nform layered octaves with divergent movement.\nHost MIDI pitch -> SlewGlide CV IN; its LINEAR\noutput tunes the left MorphVCO and EXP output\ntunes the right MorphVCO one octave up.\n\nMIDI GATE/RETRIGGER -> one shared ADSR,\nseparately gating both filter/oscillator chains\nthrough DualVCA and StereoEcho to true saved\nHostAudio2 Left and Right input routes.\n\nMacro8 A: Spark (short glide).\nMacro8 B: Velvet (warm, lyrical slide).\nMacro8 C: Comet (long, luminous lines).\nMacro8 D: Orbit (slow, asymmetric arrival).\nMacro Rise/Fall CV extends the glide time;\nLINEAR and EXP are genuinely different curves.\nSlewGlide MOVING gate stays unpatched for you\nto explore in your own modulation routing.\n\nStart with low monitor volume, play legato\nMIDI notes or sustained 8-note chords.\nSaved-source routing only: not listened to,\nplayed or level-measured in a fork DAW.\n"
      }
    }
  ],
